00:08:17.864 --> 00:08:19.499
we will try to fix

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:21.300
from a legislative point of view.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.134
But with respect

00:08:22.134 --> 00:08:23.669
to investigating President Trump,

00:08:23.669 --> 00:08:25.404
there have been so many investigations

00:08:25.404 --> 00:08:25.938
of President Trump.

00:08:25.938 --> 00:08:27.540
I don't feel like we need to spend

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:28.407
a whole lot of time

00:08:28.407 --> 00:08:29.342
investigating President Trump

00:08:29.342 --> 00:08:31.043
because the Democrats have done that

00:08:31.043 --> 00:08:32.912
for the past six years.

00:08:32.912 --> 00:08:34.814
So no one's been investigated

00:08:34.814 --> 00:08:36.315
more than Donald Trump

00:08:36.315 --> 00:08:38.651
who hasn't been investigated, Joe Biden.

00:08:38.651 --> 00:08:39.151
And that's

00:08:39.151 --> 00:08:40.586
why we're finally launching

00:08:40.586 --> 00:08:42.321
an investigation of Joe Biden,

00:08:42.321 --> 00:08:43.756
the House Oversight Committee.

00:08:43.756 --> 00:08:45.091
One investigation

00:08:45.091 --> 00:08:46.559
and I hope to have it wrapped up

00:08:46.559 --> 00:08:47.360
as soon as possible.

